            <staticText>
                <reportElement x="43" y="270" width="477" height="170" uuid="a31ba0e1-1eb6-4418-9d29-eedcbc0e15e8"/>
                <textElement textAlignment="Justified"/>
                <text><![CDATA[Dear

Invexdijin is responsible for managing a web solution through an application to obtain, with a single query on the official websites of the Colombian state, the consolidated results for criminal records issued by the National Police of Colombia, disciplinary records certificate from the Office of the Attorney General of the Nation, and the certificate of records from the Office of the Comptroller General of the Republic. If you require more specialized records such as ongoing investigations, inquiries into disqualifications for sexual offenses, or misdemeanor processes, please contact us to provide you with professional advice.]]></text>
            </staticText>
